## When to use — and when not to **[core]**

| Use this rule | Use something else |
|---------------|-------------------|
| Launch positioning + values for a new brand | Mode A |
| Revamp when messaging feels flat or misaligned | Mode B |
| Tone matrix + visual/verbal creative brief | Mode C |
| Write homepage headlines or CTAs | `seo-gtm.mdc` |
| Visual UI polish without messaging change | `incubation.mdc` Mode A |
| Feature prioritization or architecture | `incubation.mdc`, `system-design.mdc` |

