# SEO Audit

**Intent:** Identify SEO issues site-wide and deliver a prioritized fix plan. Not single-page element optimization (`seo-gtm.mdc`), not designing scaled page programs (`seo-gtm.mdc`), not backlink campaigns (`off-page-seo.mdc`).

